### GET /health — liveness probe
###
### When to use: to confirm matchmaking-api is up before running any other
### request, or as a healthcheck in scripts/monitoring.
###
### How to use: start matchmaking-api, then run the request below.
### Expected: 200 with { "status": "UP" }. No authentication required.

@apiBaseUrl = http://localhost:8080

GET {{apiBaseUrl}}/health
